  "gradeRuleDescribe": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 1.0,
    "cls_id": "XF01114",
    "sub_id": "08342",
    "scr_dup": "005",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div><strong>Classroom Rules / </strong><strong>課堂規範</strong></div>\n\n<div><strong>1. Attendance &amp; Punctuality </strong><strong>出席與準時</strong></div>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Be on time for class. 上課請準時到達。</li>\n\t<li>More than 3<strong> absences</strong> will lower your final grade. 超過 3<strong> </strong><strong>次缺席</strong> 將影響期末成績。</li>\n\t<li><strong>Late more than 15 minutes will be marked absent.</strong> 遲到超過 <strong>15 </strong><strong>分鐘</strong> 視同缺席。</li>\n\t<li>Notify the instructor in advance if you must miss class. 如需缺席，請事先告知教師。</li>\n</ul>\n\n<div><strong>2. Participation </strong><strong>課堂參與</strong></div>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Active participation is expected. 課堂中應積極參與。</li>\n\t<li>Respect others&rsquo; opinions and listen attentively. 尊重他人意見並專心聆聽。</li>\n</ul>\n\n<div><strong>3. Assignments &amp; Deadlines </strong><strong>作業與截止日期</strong></div>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Submit assignments on time. 作業需準時繳交。</li>\n\t<li>Late work may lose 5<strong>% per day</strong> (or may not be accepted). 遲交作業每天扣分 5<strong>%</strong>（或不予受理）。</li>\n\t<li>Follow the required format (word count, citation style, etc.). 作業需遵守規定格式（字數、引用格式等）。</li>\n\t<li><strong>No make-up quizzes will be given in class.</strong> 課堂小考<strong>不予補考</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n\n<div><strong>4. Academic Integrity </strong><strong>學術誠信</strong></div>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Plagiarism or cheating will result in a failing grade and possible disciplinary action. 抄襲或作弊將導致該作業不及格，並可能接受校方處分。</li>\n\t<li>Always cite sources properly. 請務必正確引用資料來源。</li>\n</ul>\n\n<div><strong>5. Classroom Etiquette </strong><strong>課堂禮儀</strong></div>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Silence phones and avoid distractions. 請將手機靜音並避免分心行為。</li>\n\t<li>Be professional and respectful in communication. 請以專業且尊重的態度與師生互動。</li>\n</ul>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": null,
    "course_pol": "1. Be on time. 請準時上課。\n2. Participate in the class discussion and class activities. 請參與課堂討論及課堂活動。\n3. Students must submit a leave application to the school in advance, stating the reason for the leave and the expected durati on.學生必須提前向學校提交請假申請，說明請假的原因和預計時間。\n4. Please purchase the original textbook, following intellectual property law. 請購買正版課本，請勿使用複製版本。\n5. The texts and exercises will be completed in class. Please bring textbooks to class. 請上課攜帶課本，以利上課活動使用。\n6. Follow the school rules to apply for a make-up Mid-term or Final exam within three days of the exam date. Relevant documents are required for the application. No-shows or those with late application will receive ZERO. The date of a make-up exam will be arranged by the instructor. 若須要期中或期末考補考的同學，請遵照學校的補考規定，在考試後的3天內提出申請。若考試當天沒有出現或者是沒有申請補考的同學，考試成績一律0分。\n7. Following the FCU Exam Regulations, cheaters will receive ZERO for their exams and such cases will be reviewed by the Student Reward and Disciplinary Committee. 考試請遵照考場規定，若作弊者以0分計算。",
    "course_pol_en": null,
    "course_rem": null,
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>1.Students must exhibit honesty and ethical behaviors&nbsp;in their academic activities, avoiding plagiarism and falsification of data. 學生在學術活動中必須展現誠實和道德行為，避免抄襲和篡改資料。 &nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>2.Plagiarism: Proper citation of sources is required. Copying or using others&#39; work without appropriate attribution is considered plagiarism. 抄襲：必須適當引用來源。未經適當標示使用他人作品屬於抄襲行為。 &nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>3.Cheating: Following exam rules is mandatory. Unauthorized materials or collusion with others during exams is considered cheating. 考試作弊：必須遵守考試規則，禁止使用未經授權的材料或與他人串通作弊。</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": null,
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
  },
